 "name": "F1 E3 · From Alex",
 "subject": "Got a golf question? Ask me",
 "preview_text": "Reply to this email and a real person who plays will answer.",
 "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en-GB\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\"><meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light only\">\n<title>Evolution Golf</title><style>@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');</style>\n<style>\nbody{margin:0;padding:0;background:#FFFFFF;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%} img{border:0;display:block} a{color:#0F3B2A}\n.foot a{color:#BCC8C3!important} .foot-light a{color:#626862!important}\n@media (max-width:620px){\n .card{width:100%!important} .px{padding-left:24px!important;padding-right:24px!important}\n .stack{display:block!important;width:100%!important;box-sizing:border-box} .nb{border-top:0!important;padding-top:0!important}\n .lbl{padding-bottom:2px!important;border-bottom:0!important} .h1{font-size:32px!important;line-height:36px!important} .full{width:100%!important;height:auto!important}\n .stack-gap{padding:0 0 18px 0!important} .panel-l,.panel-r{display:block!important;width:100%!important;text-align:left!important} .panel-r{padding-top:8px!important;padding-left:0!important}\n}\n</style></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Reply to this email and a real person who plays will answer.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"padding:24px 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" class=\"card\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"width:600px;background:#FFFFFF;\">\n<tr><td class=\"px\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"padding:44px 48px 28px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font:16px/25px Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E322F;\">Hi {{ if .Tx.Data.first_name }}{{ .Tx.Data.first_name }}{{ else }}there{{ end }},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font:16px/25px Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E322F;\">Alex here, I run the online side at Evolution Golf. Quick one: if you're weighing up a trolley, some clubs or anything else, reply to this email and tell me what you play and what you're trying to fix. I'll give you an honest answer, even if it's \"don't buy that\".</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font:16px/25px Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E322F;\">No product list in this one. Just the offer of a proper conversation.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td width=\"92\" style=\"padding-right:16px;vertical-align:top;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0499/9014/0061/files/eg-email-alex.jpg?v=1791803434\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\" alt=\"Alex\" style=\"width:76px;height:76px;border-radius:50%;display:block;\"></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;font:16px/24px Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E322F;\">Alex<br><span style=\"color:#626862;\">Head of Ecommerce, Evolution Golf</span></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:22px 0 0;font:15px/22px Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#626862;\">Rather talk? Call us on <a href=\"tel:03301227089\" style=\"color:#0F3B2A;\">0330 122 7089</a> or use our <a href=\"https://evolutiongolf.co.uk/pages/contact-us\" style=\"color:#0F3B2A;\">contact page</a>.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px foot-light\" style=\"padding:18px 48px 24px;border-top:1px solid #DDE1DD;font:12px/18px Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#626862;\">Evolution Golf, Unit 3, Parvenah Park, Embankment Way, Ringwood, BH24 1WL<br><a href=\"{{ .Tx.Data.unsubscribe_url }}\" style=\"color:inherit;\">Unsubscribe</a>{{ if .Tx.Data.preferences_url }} · <a href=\"{{ .Tx.Data.preferences_url }}\" style=\"color:inherit;\">Manage preferences</a>{{ end }}</td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
 "from_name": "Alex at Evolution Golf"
}